<main id="main"><section class="fx-hero" data-sc-act="pin" data-sc-span="1.5" aria-labelledby="fx-title"><div class="fx-stage" data-sc-stage><div class="fx-scene"><div class="fx-arch" style="--pos:46% 55%"><div class="fx-window"><img src="../assets/site/photos/hotel-reception-lobby-1040.webp" alt="A hotel lobby with a reception desk under a decorated ceiling" width="1040" height="692" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><span class="fx-beam" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><span class="fx-sill" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><span class="fx-spill" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="fx-board-wrap"><div class="fx-board" aria-hidden="true" data-nosnippet><div class="fx-board-top"><span class="fx-board-title">Maintenance · Requests</span><time class="fx-board-time" dir="ltr">06:00</time></div><ul class="fx-board-counts"><li data-count="rep"><b>2</b><span>Reported</span></li><li data-count="wip"><b>1</b><span>In progress</span></li><li data-count="fix"><b>1</b><span>Fixed</span></li></ul><ul class="fx-board-rows"><li data-row="0" data-state="rep" class="tone-warn"><span>Room 305 · Air conditioning</span><em>Reported</em></li><li data-row="1" data-state="rep" class="tone-warn"><span>Room 112 · Shower</span><em>Reported</em></li><li data-row="2" data-state="wip" class="tone-info"><span>Lobby · Lighting</span><em>In progress</em></li><li data-row="3" data-state="fix" class="tone-ok"><span>Room 418 · Television</span><em>Fixed</em></li></ul><p class="fx-board-foot"><span class="fx-board-tag">Illustrative sample data</span><span class="fx-board-log"></span></p></div></div></div><div class="fx-copy"><nav class="fx-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="../index.php">Home</a></li><li><a href="../features.php">Features</a></li><li aria-current="page">Maintenance</li></ol></nav><h1 id="fx-title">Hotel maintenance, organised around your rooms</h1><p class="fx-lead">Log an issue, follow the repair and bring the room back into service, with operations informed at every step.</p><div class="fx-cta"><button class="button primary" type="button" data-demo data-intent="Maintenance demo">Book a demo</button><a class="fx-link" href="../pricing.php#packages">See packages</a></div></div></div></section><section class="fx-pressure"><div class="fx-wrap"><h2 data-sc-in>A broken air conditioner is a room you cannot sell.</h2><p data-sc-in>Maintenance requests that travel by phone get lost between shifts. Until a repair is logged and followed, the real state of the room is a guess.</p></div></section><section class="fx-day" id="day" aria-labelledby="day-title"><div class="fx-wrap fx-day-grid"><header class="fx-day-head"><h2 id="day-title">A day with Maintenance</h2><p>Hour by hour, the board follows the day as you read.</p></header><ol class="fx-hours"><li class="fx-hour" id="h-0730" data-step="0"><p class="fx-time"><time datetime="07:30" dir="ltr">07:30</time></p><h3>An issue is reported</h3><p>Housekeeping notices the air conditioning in a room is not cooling. The request is logged against the room instead of written on paper.</p></li><li class="fx-hour" id="h-0900" data-step="1"><p class="fx-time"><time datetime="09:00" dir="ltr">09:00</time></p><h3>The repair is picked up</h3><p>The maintenance team sees open requests room by room and takes ownership of the job.</p></li><li class="fx-hour is-peak" id="h-1200" data-step="2"><p class="fx-time"><time datetime="12:00" dir="ltr">12:00</time></p><h3>Fixed, and the front desk knows</h3><p>When the work is done, the request is closed and the room&#x27;s information is up to date for the front desk and housekeeping.</p><p class="fx-extra">Every open request on the board closes as the team works through the morning.</p></li><li class="fx-hour" id="h-1700" data-step="3"><p class="fx-time"><time datetime="17:00" dir="ltr">17:00</time></p><h3>Maintenance on record</h3><p>Cleaning and maintenance reports show completed and open work, so the next shift starts informed.</p></li></ol><div class="fx-surface"><div class="fx-board fx-board--live" aria-hidden="true" data-nosnippet><div class="fx-board-top"><span class="fx-board-title">Maintenance · Requests</span><time class="fx-board-time" dir="ltr">06:00</time></div><ul class="fx-board-counts"><li data-count="rep"><b>2</b><span>Reported</span></li><li data-count="wip"><b>1</b><span>In progress</span></li><li data-count="fix"><b>1</b><span>Fixed</span></li></ul><ul class="fx-board-rows"><li data-row="0" data-state="rep" class="tone-warn"><span>Room 305 · Air conditioning</span><em>Reported</em></li><li data-row="1" data-state="rep" class="tone-warn"><span>Room 112 · Shower</span><em>Reported</em></li><li data-row="2" data-state="wip" class="tone-info"><span>Lobby · Lighting</span><em>In progress</em></li><li data-row="3" data-state="fix" class="tone-ok"><span>Room 418 · Television</span><em>Fixed</em></li></ul><p class="fx-board-foot"><span class="fx-board-tag">Illustrative sample data</span><span class="fx-board-log"></span></p></div></div></div></section><section class="fx-covers" aria-labelledby="cov-title"><div class="fx-wrap fx-covers-grid"><h2 id="cov-title">What Maintenance covers</h2><ul class="fx-list" data-sc-in data-sc-stagger="45"><li>Maintenance requests organised by room</li><li>Follow-up from the first report to the completed repair</li><li>Room information shared with housekeeping and the front desk</li><li>Cleaning and maintenance reports</li><li>Part of the operations modules in Fandaqah 360</li></ul><div class="fx-incl"><p>Included in</p><div class="fx-chips"><a class="fx-chip" href="../pricing.php#packages">Fandaqah 360</a></div><p class="fx-incl-note">The Basic Subscription includes PMS Core plus five modules, confirmed during your demo.</p><a class="fx-link" href="../pricing.php#compare">Compare packages</a></div></div></section><section class="fx-reach" data-sc-act="pin" data-sc-span="1.45" aria-labelledby="reach-title"><div class="fx-reach-stage" data-sc-stage><div class="fx-wrap"><h2 id="reach-title">Works together with</h2></div><div class="fx-rail-clip"><div class="fx-rail"><a class="fx-node" href="housekeeping.php"><span class="icon-tile"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.65" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 18h18M5 15a7 7 0 0 1 14 0v1H5v-1ZM12 8V5m-2 0h4M2 21h20"/></svg></span><strong>Housekeeping</strong><span>Room cleaning and room readiness, connected to the front desk.</span></a><a class="fx-node" href="hotel-pms.php"><span class="icon-tile"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.65" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 18v3m18-3v3M3 18h18V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9ZM3 14h18M7 10h3m4 0h3"/></svg></span><strong>PMS Core</strong><span>Reservations, room status, arrivals and departures on one dashboard.</span></a><a class="fx-node" href="inventory.php"><span class="icon-tile"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.65" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 9 5v10l-9 5-9-5V8l9-5ZM3 8l9 5 9-5M12 13v10M7 5l10 6"/></svg></span><strong>Inventory</strong><span>Hotel stock and supplies, tracked in the same platform.</span></a><a class="fx-node" href="purchasing.php"><span class="icon-tile"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.65" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 3h3l3 13h11l3-9H6M9 19h.01M18 19h.01"/><circle cx="9" cy="20" r="1"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1"/></svg></span><strong>Purchasing</strong><span>Procurement from request to supplier payment.</span></a><a class="fx-node fx-node--all" href="../features.php"><strong>All 20 features</strong><span>Four departments, one platform.</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class="fx-faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="fx-wrap fx-faq-grid"><h2 id="faq-title">Questions about Maintenance</h2><div class="fx-qa"><details><summary>Can housekeeping report maintenance issues?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Housekeeping and maintenance work in the same platform, so an issue found during cleaning can be passed to maintenance. We review the exact workflow for your property during the demo.</p></details><details><summary>Does Fandaqah report on maintenance?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Yes. The reports include cleaning and maintenance information alongside the other operational reports.</p></details><details><summary>Which package includes Maintenance?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Maintenance is one of the 20 modules in Fandaqah 360 (SAR 3,495 a year plus VAT). The Basic Subscription includes PMS Core plus five modules, confirmed during your demo.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="fx-night" id="report" aria-labelledby="night-title"><div class="fx-wrap fx-night-grid"><div class="fx-report"><p class="fx-report-head"><span>Maintenance</span><span>Day report</span></p><ol class="fx-report-lines"><li data-step="0"><time dir="ltr">07:30</time><span>Maintenance request logged for room 305</span></li><li data-step="1"><time dir="ltr">09:00</time><span>Repairs assigned to the maintenance team</span></li><li data-step="2"><time dir="ltr">12:00</time><span>Repairs completed and rooms updated</span></li><li data-step="3"><time dir="ltr">17:00</time><span>Maintenance report reviewed</span></li></ol><p class="fx-report-total">Maintenance is part of Fandaqah 360, with all 20 modules: <bdi>SAR 3,495</bdi> a year plus VAT (<bdi>SAR 4,019.25</bdi> including VAT).</p><p class="fx-report-key"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Logged while you were here</p></div><div class="fx-night-copy"><h2 id="night-title">23:59. <span>The day is closed.</span></h2><p>Tomorrow starts at 06:00. Book a demo and see your property’s day on Fandaqah.</p><div class="fx-cta"><button class="button primary" type="button" data-demo data-intent="Maintenance demo">Book a demo</button><a class="fx-link" href="../pricing.php#compare">Compare packages</a></div></div></div></section></main>
